{"seq":2,"slug":"flow-applications","title":"应用：密度估计、生成采样与变分推断三大主场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/normalizing-flows/practice/flow-applications","wordCount":1612,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"应用-密度估计-生成采样与变分推断三大主场\">应用：密度估计、生成采样与变分推断三大主场</h1><p>标准化流值不值得学，最终要看它能干成什么别的模型干不了或干不好的事。答案落在三个方向，恰好对应流的两个能力——精确算密度、精确采样。密度估计吃的是&quot;算密度&quot;，生成吃的是&quot;采样&quot;，变分推断则两个都要。这一篇把三大主场逐一展开，并点出各自 2026 年最活跃的落地场景，让你判断手上的任务是不是流的菜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-能力到应用的映射\">核心概念：能力到应用的映射</h2><p>流的两项精确能力，各自派生出一组应用。先用一张图把映射关系钉死：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Flow[&quot;标准化流&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;精确算密度 p(x)&quot;]&#10;  Flow --&gt; S[&quot;精确采样 x~p&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; A1[&quot;密度估计 / 异常检测&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; A2[&quot;似然比 / 基于模拟的推断&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt; A3[&quot;生成建模&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; A4[&quot;变分推断: 灵活后验 q(z)&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt; A4\">flowchart TD\n  Flow[\"标准化流\"] --&gt; D[\"精确算密度 p(x)\"]\n  Flow --&gt; S[\"精确采样 x~p\"]\n  D --&gt; A1[\"密度估计 / 异常检测\"]\n  D --&gt; A2[\"似然比 / 基于模拟的推断\"]\n  S --&gt; A3[\"生成建模\"]\n  D --&gt; A4[\"变分推断: 灵活后验 q(z)\"]\n  S --&gt; A4</pre><p>下表把三大主场和它们依赖的能力、竞争对手、以及流的相对优势摆清：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用</th>\n<th>依赖能力</th>\n<th>主要竞争者</th>\n<th>流的相对优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>密度估计 / 异常检测</td>\n<td>精确密度</td>\n<td>KDE、GMM、自编码器</td>\n<td>高维可扩展、密度精确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>似然比 / SBI</td>\n<td>精确密度</td>\n<td>ABC、比率估计</td>\n<td>直接给出可微似然</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成采样</td>\n<td>精确采样</td>\n<td>扩散、GAN、VAE</td>\n<td>精确似然 + 一步/少步采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变分后验</td>\n<td>密度 + 采样</td>\n<td>平均场、MCMC</td>\n<td>后验灵活、熵项精确</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"主场一-密度估计与异常检测\">主场一：密度估计与异常检测</h2><p>这是流最纯粹的主场。给定样本，直接算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，密度低于阈值即判异常——逻辑简单到近乎粗暴，但正因为流的密度是精确的而非下界或近似，这个判断才严谨。相比<a href=\"../../kernel-density-estimation/foundations/why-kde\">核密度估计</a>在高维下遭遇维数灾难、相比高斯混合只能表达有限模态，流用深变换在几百上千维上仍能拟合复杂多峰密度。</p>\n<p>一个反直觉的坑值得警惕：多项研究发现，在自然图像上训练的流，对某些结构更简单的分布外（OOD）图像反而给出更高的密度。原因是流的似然被低层统计量（如局部平滑度）主导，而非语义。所以流做 OOD 检测时，实践中常用似然比（用一个背景模型归一化）而非裸似然。这类问题也把流推向了<a href=\"../../bayesian-data-analysis/foundations/bayesian-thinking\">似然比与基于模拟的推断</a>：物理、天文、流行病学里，仿真器能生成数据但写不出似然，流可以从仿真样本里学出可微的替代似然 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x\\mid\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，让参数推断变得可行——这是 2020 年以来 SBI 领域流的杀手级用途。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主场二-生成建模\">主场二：生成建模</h2><p>作为生成模型，流的独特卖点不是样本最漂亮（2026 年那是扩散和 flow matching 的天下），而是&quot;生成的同时给出精确似然&quot;，以及某些架构的采样极快。经典逐层耦合流（<a href=\"../architectures/invertible-blocks\">Glow</a>）采样是一次前向、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 网络调用，比扩散的几十步迭代快得多——在对延迟敏感、又要似然可控的场景（如实时语音合成里的 Parallel WaveNet，用 <a href=\"../architectures/autoregressive-flows\">IAF</a> 蒸馏）这是硬优势。</p>\n<p>2026 年生成这条线的重心已明显移向 flow matching 训练的连续流：它用回归目标训练，采样时解一次 ODE，样本质量追平扩散且步数更少，已在图像、分子构象、蛋白质骨架生成上密集落地（据 2025–2026 年 npj Artificial Intelligence 等综述）。所以&quot;用流做生成&quot;在今天往往意味着用 <a href=\"../jacobian/continuous-flows\">flow matching / 连续流</a>，而非堆 RealNVP。经典逐层流的生成价值，更多留在需要精确密度的科学采样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主场三-作为变分推断的灵活后验\">主场三：作为变分推断的灵活后验</h2><p>这是流最优雅、也最能体现&quot;密度 + 采样都要&quot;的用途。变分推断要用一个可优化的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_\\phi(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 近似难算的后验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(z\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，目标是最大化 ELBO：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{ELBO} = \\mathbb{E}_{q_\\phi(z)}\\big[\\log p(x, z) - \\log q_\\phi(z)\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">ELBO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2333em;vertical-align:-0.3833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3833em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>传统平均场用对角高斯当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，表达力太弱、抓不住后验的相关与多峰。用流当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>——从简单基分布采样再经流变换——立刻解决两个问题：采样容易（生成方向），而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log q_\\phi(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 里的熵项因为流能精确算密度而可精确评估。这就是归一化流变分推断（Rezende &amp; Mohamed, 2015 的开山之作），也是&quot;normalizing flow&quot;这个名字的出处。<a href=\"../architectures/autoregressive-flows\">IAF</a> 因采样并行，特别适合当变分后验（IAF-VAE）。</p>\n<p>需要强调分工：本篇只讲流如何充当后验分布族这一个接口，变分推断的完整框架（ELBO 推导、平均场、随机 VI、重参数化）属于兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../variational-inference/foundations/why-vi\">变分推断</a>，那里才是主场。流在这里是&quot;零件&quot;，不是&quot;整机&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个横跨三主场的例子-概率建模流水线\">一个横跨三主场的例子：概率建模流水线</h2><p>把三者串起来看一个真实流水线。做一个异常检测系统：先用流在正常数据上极大似然训练（<a href=\"flow-training\">训练</a>），得到密度模型；上线时对新样本算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 做密度阈值检测（主场一）；为了给运维看&quot;正常长什么样&quot;，从流采样几个典型样本可视化（主场二）；若还想估计某个隐含参数的后验，把流嵌进变分推断当后验族（主场三）。同一个流，三种能力被同时压榨——这正是流&quot;密度与采样皆精确&quot;的复利。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>流的应用是两项精确能力的派生：算密度 → 密度估计/异常检测/似然比推断；采样 → 生成；两者兼需 → 变分后验。</li>\n<li>密度估计是流最纯粹的主场，高维可扩展且密度精确；但裸似然做 OOD 有陷阱，实践用似然比；SBI 是其杀手级用途。</li>\n<li>生成方面 2026 年重心移向 flow matching 连续流（质量追平扩散、步数更少），经典逐层流的生成价值留在科学采样与低延迟场景。</li>\n<li>作为变分后验，流让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 表达力大增且熵项精确可算，是&quot;normalizing flow&quot;名字的由来；完整 VI 框架归兄弟 hub。</li>\n<li>同一个训练好的流可同时服务三大主场，体现&quot;密度与采样皆精确&quot;的复利价值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>这些应用的模型怎么训出来：<a href=\"flow-training\">训练与最大似然</a></li>\n<li>落地选库与边界判断：<a href=\"flows-in-practice\">落地与边界</a></li>\n<li>生成主场的前沿路线：<a href=\"../jacobian/continuous-flows\">连续流</a></li>\n<li>变分后验用的并行采样架构：<a href=\"../architectures/autoregressive-flows\">自回归流</a></li>\n<li>跨库：变分推断完整框架见<a href=\"../../variational-inference/foundations/why-vi\">变分推断</a>；密度估计的对照方法见<a href=\"../../kernel-density-estimation/foundations/why-kde\">核密度估计</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"应用：密度估计、生成采样与变分推断三大主场","id":"应用-密度估计-生成采样与变分推断三大主场"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：能力到应用的映射","id":"核心概念-能力到应用的映射"},{"level":2,"text":"主场一：密度估计与异常检测","id":"主场一-密度估计与异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"主场二：生成建模","id":"主场二-生成建模"},{"level":2,"text":"主场三：作为变分推断的灵活后验","id":"主场三-作为变分推断的灵活后验"},{"level":2,"text":"一个横跨三主场的例子：概率建模流水线","id":"一个横跨三主场的例子-概率建模流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"训练与最大似然：流为何天生适合 MLE，以及那些坑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/normalizing-flows/practice/flow-training"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界：2026 年选库、选模型与诚实的取舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/normalizing-flows/practice/flows-in-practice"}}